exports[`a synthetic extended metamodel > matches a snapshot 1`] = `
"# istar-2.0 metamodel

## Actor kinds
- istar.Actor (Actor)
- istar.Agent (Agent)
- istar.Role (Role)

## Node kinds
- istar.Goal (Goal) [inner]
- istar.Quality (Quality) [inner]
- istar.Resource (Resource) [inner]
- istar.Task (Task) [inner]
- x.Milestone (Milestone) [inner]

## Link kinds
- istar.IsALink (Is-A): actor link, istar.Actor, istar.Agent, istar.Role → istar.Actor, istar.Agent, istar.Role
- istar.ParticipatesInLink (Participates-In): actor link, istar.Actor, istar.Agent, istar.Role → istar.Actor, istar.Agent, istar.Role
- istar.DependencyLink (Dependency): dependency link, istar.Actor, istar.Agent, istar.Role, istar.Goal, istar.Quality, istar.Resource, istar.Task, x.Milestone → istar.Actor, istar.Agent, istar.Role, istar.Goal, istar.Quality, istar.Resource, istar.Task, x.Milestone
- istar.AndRefinementLink (And-Refinement): node link, istar.Goal, istar.Quality, istar.Resource, istar.Task, x.Milestone → istar.Goal, istar.Quality, istar.Resource, istar.Task, x.Milestone
- istar.OrRefinementLink (Or-Refinement): node link, istar.Goal, istar.Quality, istar.Resource, istar.Task, x.Milestone → istar.Goal, istar.Quality, istar.Resource, istar.Task, x.Milestone
- istar.NeededByLink (Needed-By): node link, istar.Goal, istar.Quality, istar.Resource, istar.Task, x.Milestone → istar.Goal, istar.Quality, istar.Resource, istar.Task, x.Milestone
- istar.QualificationLink (Qualification): node link, istar.Goal, istar.Quality, istar.Resource, istar.Task, x.Milestone → istar.Goal, istar.Quality, istar.Resource, istar.Task, x.Milestone
- istar.ContributionLink (Contribution): node link, istar.Goal, istar.Quality, istar.Resource, istar.Task, x.Milestone → istar.Goal, istar.Quality, istar.Resource, istar.Task, x.Milestone; values: make, help, hurt, break
- x.Joint (Joint) [n-ary, via a hub]: node link, istar.Goal, x.Milestone → istar.Goal, x.Milestone"
`;

